From 056970aac6c168881c234e5aa12df26725428a19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:28:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Audit fix a: a release names the agreement it closes

roster_moves.waive and the guarantee review took the player's oldest signed
record, so Jumaine Jones's 2006-01-07 release was filed under his voided
2003-09-30 camp contract and merged his 2005 terms into it. Both now use
contract_archive.signed_record: the signing whose date is the sheet entry's,
else the latest. The one misfiled record is corrected to name the 2005-10-04
agreement (record and contract ids), with a correction note; the 2003
agreement stays voided on 2003-10-27. No decision or game input reads a
released record's contract id (signings() and the extension check read only
signed records).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ExmaEeFA7X8K2pJG6n4PLH
